- H3: Copyright (c) 2018-2024 Uber Technologies, Inc.
- H3 is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (the "License").
  See https://github.com/uber/h3 and the LICENSE file therein for details.

This repository does not link to or depend on H3 C at runtime. The test
oracle under `testref/` downloads and builds the H3 C reference (v4.3.0)
as a standalone CLI for parity testing only; it is not part of this Go
module and is excluded from the library build.

No source code from the H3 C implementation is copied verbatim. The
algorithms are reimplemented based on public documentation and observed
behavior of the reference implementation.
